  "description": "<p>A number of small changes should be made to prepare fcrepo-camel for graduation from the -labs organization. They include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Decouple fcrepo-camel runtime from fcrepo server code</li>\n\t<li>Adjust maven configuration to include release-related artifacts; sonatype parent</li>\n\t<li>Use an embedded fuseki server (rather than a containerized servlet) for the triplestore integration tests</li>\n\t<li>Improve the integration tests to do more checking of body content</li>\n</ul>\n\n",
